<title>UK: Lasmo shares gain, Panmure positive.</title>
<headline>Lasmo shares gain, Panmure positive.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Lasmo Plc added eight pence to 251-1/2 pence after broker Panmure Gordon reiterated its buy recommendation.</p>
<p>Analyst Elisabeth Butler said Lasmo looked cheap, adding the stock was trading at a lower cash flow multiple, while having a &quot;bigger opportunity value&quot; than rivals such Enterprise Oil Plc.</p>
<p>Butler particularly liked Lasmo's bigger international spread compared with Enterprise, which fell three pence to 675-1/2.</p>
<p>Lasmo has already been a strong performer this month as it was boosted by higher oil prices.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
